<p>I like this one. SCP-1202 sounds the way I would expect an egotistical researcher from the Foundation to talk, especially to someone he considers beneath him.</p>
<p>A couple of nitpicks. I would expect in the description, the report would say which hand was on the forehead and which was digging into his ear canal. Was the other ear damaged as well?</p>
<p>Also, in the containment procedure, the first two sentences are a little confusing. It is hard to tell who should be fitted in full body clothing from the first sentences. Maybe something like &quot;The subject exposed to SCP-1202 is to be quarantined from other site staff and personnel unless the subject is outfitted in clothing completely covering their entire body. This skin suit is to be equipped to the exposed subject immediately upon transfer of SCP-1202 to the subject.&quot; Just a suggestion-this SCP is already highly thought of. Upvoted.</p>

