wants to suffer through 'blocks' of text. When you indent at the beginning of a paragraph, you are giving the reader's brain a place to begin reading. Indentation also implies that a written piece has an air of professionalism, and is expected to be read as a story; rather than a text message from a friend.</p>
<p>On the other hand, kudos for correct spelling and punctuation.</p>

